<title>BELGIUM: CYCLING-LEADING POSITIONS IN GHENT SIX-DAY RACE.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-LEADING POSITIONS IN GHENT SIX-DAY RACE.</headline>
<dateline>GHENT, Belgium 1996-11-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading positions after</p>
<p>the fourth day of the Ghent six-day cycling race on Friday:</p>
<p> 1. Andreas Kappes/Carsten Wolf (Germany)	 322 pts</p>
<p>one lap behind:</p>
<p>Risi/Kurt Betschart (Switzerland)	  350</p>
<p>3. Etienne De Wilde/Adriano Baffi (Belgium/Italy) 294</p>
<p> 4. Jens Veggerby/Jimmi Madsen (Denmark)	     279</p>
<p> 5. Silvio Martinello/Marco Villa (Italy)	    248</p>
<p>three laps behind:</p>
<p>6. Matthew Gilmore/Jakob Piil Storm (Australia/Denmark)</p>
<p>253</p>
</text>
